"# Source Code\n\nThis directory contains reusable Python components extracted from the experimental implementations used in the project.\n\nThe source code is organized around the main stages of the experimental pipeline:\n\n- Data preparation\n- Model architectures\n- Training\n- Evaluation\n- Calibration\n- Robustness testing\n- Utilities and result handling\n\nThe notebooks in `notebooks/` are used for experiment configuration, execution, and analysis.\n\nReusable functionality will be progressively separated from the original experimental notebooks as the repository is organized.\n"